lmrs-container (0.1.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * token_count and estimate accept prompt text: the server counts with the
    runtime tokenizer, sizes against the cached model config and measured
    capacity, and returns the dry-run admission verdict.
  * Every command documents itself in the fleet metadata paradigm; info
    publishes the service guide plus exhaustive per-command documentation.
  * The lmrs-client package ships the lmrs-client CLI and the fleet pipeline
    acceptance runner (cli-surface, info-docs-live, prompt-admission-live,
    commands-live).

